1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,820
I hope you know distance never separates two hearts that really care.

2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:08,440
Our memories span the miles and in seconds we're there.

3
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:15,640
Whenever I start feeling sad because I miss you, I remind myself how lucky I am

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,040
to have someone so special to miss.
